'''Gokarna''' is a temple town and beach destination in [[Uttara Kannada]], [[Karnataka]].

== Understand ==
A pilgrimage town for centuries, Gokarna became a quieter alternative to [[Goa]] in the 1990s.

==See==
{{see|name=Mahabaleshwar Temple|alt=Mahabaleshwara|lat=14.5433|long=74.3172|hours=6AM–12:30PM, 5PM–8PM|content=Houses the ''Atmalinga''; men must remove shirts. {{nowrap|Dress code}} applies.}}
